WEBVTT

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:05.060
No, no, no! You should have
evaded that easily!

00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:08.730
Are you going to disappoint me, too?

00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:16.750
This is still a mere illusion.

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:19.620
Once I know the secret, 
it's no challenge at all!

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:21.710
The Spectre...

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:23.660
Seth...

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:30.000
I see, I see! That was a close one!

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.260
Now, hurry and get back on your feet!

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:35.660
Stand and fight back against me!

00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:38.780
Come! Come! Come!

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:45.930
Is that it? Is that all you can do?!

00:00:47.650 --> 00:00:52.900
Horned sorcerer, 
I think very highly of your abilities.

00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:57.910
There are many sorcerers, 
but none have the vitality that you do.

00:00:58.540 --> 00:01:02.090
That is why I hoped 
that you would escape.

00:01:02.660 --> 00:01:07.990
If you don't fight back against me, 
I will grow bored!

00:01:07.990 --> 00:01:12.420
Fighting a sorcerer 
is an immense challenge!

00:01:12.420 --> 00:01:17.570
Most people fear your kind, after all.

00:01:17.570 --> 00:01:23.970
On my beard, I must protect the people!

00:01:24.530 --> 00:01:25.580
"Protect"?

00:01:26.310 --> 00:01:29.310
You keep saying things 
that sound so noble.

00:01:29.310 --> 00:01:32.860
They're scared, 
but they want to enslave us.

00:01:33.340 --> 00:01:35.820
That's what you wanted, isn't it?!

00:01:37.700 --> 00:01:39.450
Kill them, quickly!

00:01:39.450 --> 00:01:43.130
Any infected who do not obey orders 
are no better than garbage!

00:01:43.130 --> 00:01:44.370
You little...

00:01:45.830 --> 00:01:48.640
I'm saying I'll give you 
a place to belong!

00:01:48.640 --> 00:01:49.970
Why don't you understand?

00:01:49.970 --> 00:01:52.800
We'll decide 
where we belong for ourselves!

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:55.340
We have no interest in being your slaves!

00:01:55.340 --> 00:01:58.410
Enslave? What complaint 
do you have with that?

00:01:58.410 --> 00:02:02.720
You lot are less than human, 
and we're offering to take you in!

00:02:02.720 --> 00:02:05.470
Less than... human?!

00:02:06.230 --> 00:02:09.130
Just look at us!

00:02:09.130 --> 00:02:11.870
Even without being infected like you,

00:02:11.870 --> 00:02:14.730
we succeeded in obtaining such great power.

00:02:14.730 --> 00:02:17.650
This is humanity in its purest form!

00:02:19.490 --> 00:02:23.370
Are you ready to give up 
and become a slave already?

00:02:23.370 --> 00:02:26.350
But that's no fun for me.

00:02:25.140 --> 00:02:26.710
Who's the slave?

00:02:27.190 --> 00:02:28.750
What are you talking about?

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:30.600
Between you and me...

00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:35.130
which one is really a slave 
to a stupid idea like that?!

00:02:33.250 --> 00:02:34.500
What?!

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:39.130
What's this?

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:42.910
Gysoni!

00:02:50.190 --> 00:02:52.340
You can put chains on us

00:02:52.900 --> 00:02:54.770
and put us in cages.

00:02:55.090 --> 00:02:58.900
We'll just smash our way 
out of them, anyway!

00:02:58.900 --> 00:03:02.280
We are infected! We are survivors!

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:04.530
But we're absolutely not...

00:03:04.530 --> 00:03:06.790
...less than human!

00:03:07.270 --> 00:03:10.540
We are human!

00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:17.150
Ah, what bliss!

00:03:17.150 --> 00:03:21.300
Now, this is the ultimate battle I wanted!

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:28.270
I'm so grateful to have finally found 
a strong opponent like you!

00:03:26.180 --> 00:03:30.290
That's not what I'd call a compliment!

00:03:32.170 --> 00:03:36.480
Farewell, horned sorcerer!

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:41.090
On my beard!

00:05:42.980 --> 00:05:48.990
<b>I Can't Hear Your Voice 
-Myrddin-</b>

00:05:45.380 --> 00:05:47.390
<i>"I Can't Hear Your Voice."</i>

00:05:49.550 --> 00:05:52.610
<i>At the end of an intense battle,</i>

00:05:52.610 --> 00:05:54.860
<i>Seth defeated the Thaumaturge Santori.</i>

00:05:55.340 --> 00:05:59.310
<i>The Merchant Barons, the ones responsible 
for this war behind the scenes,</i>

00:05:59.310 --> 00:06:01.460
<i>were also backed into a corner by Ocoho.</i>

00:06:01.900 --> 00:06:05.910
<i>It seemed as if this would be the end
 of the fighting.</i>

00:06:05.910 --> 00:06:07.010
<i>However...</i>

00:06:09.090 --> 00:06:11.510
A lowly infected slave dares to defy me?

00:06:11.510 --> 00:06:13.080
Just give up.

00:06:13.080 --> 00:06:15.860
Your scheme ends here.

00:06:15.860 --> 00:06:19.620
After everything you've done, 
no excuse you make will mean anything!

00:06:21.670 --> 00:06:24.150
Hey! What do you think you're doing?!

00:06:24.830 --> 00:06:26.150
Farewell.

00:06:26.990 --> 00:06:27.650
You fool!

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:38.060
Wait!

00:06:37.550 --> 00:06:38.730
Coward!

00:06:38.060 --> 00:06:39.290
Take us with you!

00:06:39.290 --> 00:06:40.170
Me, too!

00:06:40.610 --> 00:06:42.740
Wait! You guys...

00:06:42.740 --> 00:06:44.290
Are you kidding me?!

00:06:45.420 --> 00:06:48.670
You cowards!

00:06:51.810 --> 00:06:53.680
Thank you for the help, Alkon.

00:06:54.140 --> 00:06:57.610
I'm impressed you succeeded in jumping 
on board in the midst of all that.

00:06:57.610 --> 00:07:01.690
Well, I certainly couldn't be 
the only one to fall.

00:07:01.690 --> 00:07:04.600
Hmph. Some things never change.

00:07:04.600 --> 00:07:05.690
Oh, no!

00:07:05.690 --> 00:07:09.070
Doussant, what happened? 
This isn't what we discussed!

00:07:09.070 --> 00:07:12.950
Wasn't this country going to be ours?

00:07:12.950 --> 00:07:14.670
H-He's right!

00:07:14.670 --> 00:07:17.880
Th-That was such a scary thing 
to go through, too.

00:07:17.880 --> 00:07:18.750
Don't be hasty.

00:07:19.710 --> 00:07:22.260
This country will be ours either way.

00:07:23.390 --> 00:07:26.590
Our virtuous envoy is a victim.

00:07:26.590 --> 00:07:29.930
Word will spread throughout
 the surrounding countries

00:07:29.930 --> 00:07:31.710
that Cyfandir has a suspicious power

00:07:31.710 --> 00:07:34.260
which makes it a threat to the world.

00:07:34.260 --> 00:07:35.900
It's all in how you say it, isn't it?

00:07:35.900 --> 00:07:37.540
Wait, what?

00:07:37.540 --> 00:07:40.730
Is it going to be mine or not?

00:07:42.230 --> 00:07:45.110
The gears have started to turn.

00:07:50.490 --> 00:07:51.990
Mordred!

00:07:51.990 --> 00:07:53.140
Are you hurt?

00:07:53.140 --> 00:07:55.740
No! It's your Gysoni!

00:07:55.740 --> 00:07:58.920
Undo the Gysoni! Hurry!

00:07:58.920 --> 00:08:02.750
What is this? 
It's messing with my head!

00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:04.380
This is your fault!

00:08:05.900 --> 00:08:07.140
Mordred...

00:08:07.740 --> 00:08:09.830
Is this what emotion is?!

00:08:09.830 --> 00:08:11.880
No! I don't want this!

00:08:11.880 --> 00:08:14.890
I have no need for any of this!

00:08:17.340 --> 00:08:19.940
Stop it... please.

00:08:19.940 --> 00:08:21.340
I can't take any more.

00:08:21.340 --> 00:08:22.740
That's all it took to do this to you?

00:08:23.860 --> 00:08:25.280
Mordred...

00:08:25.280 --> 00:08:28.400
Once the Gysoni is gone, 
you'll forget the pain

00:08:28.400 --> 00:08:32.130
along with Sagramore and me, you know?

00:08:32.130 --> 00:08:32.950
But, see...

00:08:33.780 --> 00:08:35.510
I won't.

00:08:36.660 --> 00:08:38.580
Sagramore...

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:42.700
You were my best friend, and I...

00:08:57.260 --> 00:08:58.760
<i>Charge!</i>

00:08:58.760 --> 00:09:01.270
It's as though that's the only thing 
you know how to do.

00:09:05.270 --> 00:09:07.870
You insist on relying only on strength?

00:09:11.270 --> 00:09:16.280
I suppose this is the best plan 
you barbaric sorcerers can come up with.

00:09:16.280 --> 00:09:20.160
Wrong! This is only 
the beginning of our plan!

00:09:20.160 --> 00:09:21.220
<i>Behold!</i>

00:09:21.220 --> 00:09:22.730
<i>Thaumaturge...</i>

00:09:22.730 --> 00:09:23.910
<i></i>This<i> is...</i>

00:09:23.910 --> 00:09:27.170
<i>the only thing we know how to do!</i>

00:09:30.790 --> 00:09:31.920
Don't tell me...

00:09:32.670 --> 00:09:34.320
This is what you were after?

00:09:39.800 --> 00:09:41.680
Did we win?

00:09:41.680 --> 00:09:45.470
You drowned in your own power, Thaumaturge!

00:09:46.440 --> 00:09:49.390
How d'ya like that?! We win!

00:09:49.940 --> 00:09:52.330
<i>That was a fantastic plan!</i>

00:09:52.330 --> 00:09:56.500
<i>On Merlin's name, we laud your wisdom!</i>

00:09:57.350 --> 00:09:59.390
More! Praise me more!

00:10:00.570 --> 00:10:03.830
What is this unpleasant feeling?

00:10:07.540 --> 00:10:08.690
<i>This is...</i>

00:10:08.690 --> 00:10:10.130
<i>How very strange.</i>

00:10:10.130 --> 00:10:13.850
<i>The Fantasia is disappearing 
from the forest.</i>

00:10:13.850 --> 00:10:15.210
What?!

00:10:15.210 --> 00:10:16.640
You mean...

00:10:16.640 --> 00:10:18.590
Is it the machine Ocoho spoke of?!

00:10:18.590 --> 00:10:19.860
A machine?

00:10:19.860 --> 00:10:23.600
Yes, but why is it coming from the forest?

00:10:25.410 --> 00:10:28.270
<i>You! Explain what you just did—</i>

00:10:30.010 --> 00:10:32.730
Wait up, you brat!

00:10:35.500 --> 00:10:37.830
<i>I'm getting dizzy inside your stomach!</i>

00:10:37.830 --> 00:10:40.110
<i>My deepest condolences.</i>

00:10:45.490 --> 00:10:48.500
Was this Major Ullmina's doing?

00:10:54.310 --> 00:10:57.050
<i>That brat is quick 
when he's running away!</i>

00:10:57.050 --> 00:10:58.200
<i>Leave him.</i>

00:10:58.200 --> 00:11:02.190
<i>Is that machine 
not a far bigger problem right now?</i>

00:11:02.190 --> 00:11:04.900
<i>Yes... It's taking away the Fantasia?</i>

00:11:04.900 --> 00:11:06.870
<i>This does not bode well at all.</i>

00:11:06.870 --> 00:11:08.020
<i>Indeed.</i>

00:11:08.020 --> 00:11:10.890
<i>On Merlin's name, we must stop it!</i>

00:11:10.890 --> 00:11:12.420
<i>Yes! Let's go!</i>

00:11:12.420 --> 00:11:13.090
<i>Right!</i>

00:11:13.090 --> 00:11:14.650
Wait! Wait! Wait!

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:16.170
Stop it!

00:11:16.170 --> 00:11:19.090
Our job was to rescue 
the queen, wasn't it?!

00:11:19.090 --> 00:11:20.950
We achieved our goal, right?!

00:11:20.950 --> 00:11:23.540
And we need to take her back 
immediately, right?!

00:11:23.540 --> 00:11:27.050
<i>What a little coward! 
And after everything that's happened!</i>

00:11:27.050 --> 00:11:29.310
<i>Perhaps our assessment of him 
was mistaken.</i>

00:11:29.310 --> 00:11:31.160
<i>He's a loser! A loser!</i>

00:11:31.160 --> 00:11:32.430
Shut up!

00:11:32.430 --> 00:11:35.100
Only idiots march into danger voluntarily!

00:11:35.100 --> 00:11:36.220
<i>You're the idiot!</i>

00:11:36.220 --> 00:11:37.140
Excuse me?!

00:11:37.140 --> 00:11:38.320
<i>What will we do with the queen?</i>

00:11:38.320 --> 00:11:40.200
<i>What can we do except carry her?</i>

00:11:40.200 --> 00:11:41.170
<i>True.</i>

00:11:41.170 --> 00:11:42.630
Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait—

00:11:53.540 --> 00:11:56.940
The Harmonizium has successfully 
been placed in Caillte's forest.

00:11:56.940 --> 00:11:59.040
It is confirmed functional.

00:11:59.040 --> 00:12:00.450
Good.

00:12:00.450 --> 00:12:03.570
Make sure it maintains maximum output.

00:12:04.060 --> 00:12:05.880
Are you sure about this?

00:12:05.880 --> 00:12:09.680
That ancient forest will be completely lost.

00:12:09.680 --> 00:12:11.290
That doesn't matter.

00:12:11.290 --> 00:12:14.130
We have lost Colonel Santori.

00:12:14.130 --> 00:12:17.130
The infected must be made to realize 
the gravity of their crime

00:12:17.130 --> 00:12:19.070
and regret what they have done.

00:12:19.070 --> 00:12:19.840
But—

00:12:20.820 --> 00:12:23.220
Oh, I'm sorry. It was a reflex.

00:12:23.570 --> 00:12:26.230
Th-Then... what should our forces do?

00:12:26.230 --> 00:12:30.290
There is no need for our comrades 
to shed any more blood.

00:12:30.900 --> 00:12:32.900
Order the soldiers to withdraw.

00:12:32.900 --> 00:12:33.930
Yes, ma'am.

00:12:39.340 --> 00:12:45.240
Now I shall extend my blessing 
to those who lost their lives.

00:12:45.830 --> 00:12:50.260
Upon using my miracle, 
I will become completely powerless.

00:12:50.260 --> 00:12:52.940
Please protect me from any evildoers.

00:12:52.940 --> 00:12:54.870
O-Of course!

00:12:55.950 --> 00:13:00.380
Oh Father of the Inquisition, 
founder of miracles...

00:13:00.380 --> 00:13:04.370
By your divine light, 
guide those who are lost!

00:13:13.060 --> 00:13:15.220
All of you have been blessed

00:13:15.220 --> 00:13:17.400
and made into miracle children.

00:13:17.710 --> 00:13:21.850
Now, you must buy some time for me.

00:13:29.110 --> 00:13:30.300
Boobrie...

00:13:31.750 --> 00:13:34.470
What? Are you telling me to get up?

00:13:34.840 --> 00:13:36.510
Okay, fine.

00:13:38.420 --> 00:13:40.160
That corpse moved!

00:13:40.160 --> 00:13:42.090
H-He's alive?!

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:43.170
Oh, sorry. I didn't realize.

00:13:43.170 --> 00:13:44.690
You won't fool us!

00:13:44.690 --> 00:13:47.250
The corpses that were touched by the light 
that Thaumaturge unleashed,

00:13:47.250 --> 00:13:50.330
both friend and foe alike, 
came back to life and attacked us!

00:13:50.330 --> 00:13:51.220
And you're—

00:13:51.220 --> 00:13:53.800
Wait, hang on! 
What are you talking about?

00:13:53.800 --> 00:13:55.910
This one doesn't have any light.

00:13:55.910 --> 00:13:58.510
So... you really are alive?

00:13:58.510 --> 00:14:00.750
Of course I'm alive.

00:14:00.750 --> 00:14:04.260
Anyway, what do you mean, 
they came back to life?

00:14:04.260 --> 00:14:06.780
I don't know, but...

00:14:06.780 --> 00:14:08.700
Yeah! Just like that!

00:14:08.700 --> 00:14:10.700
The corpses just started moving, and...

00:14:10.700 --> 00:14:12.710
Wait, we're surrounded!

00:14:13.700 --> 00:14:15.700
Skull Burst!

00:14:16.950 --> 00:14:18.730
He cut a path through them!

00:14:18.210 --> 00:14:19.750
It's weaker than usual?

00:14:18.730 --> 00:14:21.070
Now's our chance to run through!

00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:22.460
No... the Fantasia is running thin?

00:14:26.580 --> 00:14:27.410
Jill...

00:14:28.450 --> 00:14:30.220
Did something happen in the forest?

00:14:34.110 --> 00:14:36.400
<i>Melie, Doc, Ocoho!</i>

00:14:36.400 --> 00:14:37.530
<i>It's the forest!</i>

00:14:37.530 --> 00:14:40.230
<i>If you can hear me, come to the forest!</i>

00:14:42.590 --> 00:14:43.530
Seth...

00:14:44.230 --> 00:14:46.980
Is that Seth?

00:14:46.980 --> 00:14:50.240
<i>Is this voice coming from the Sidh?</i>

00:14:50.240 --> 00:14:52.990
Darn it! What's going on now?!

00:14:56.410 --> 00:14:58.170
<i>Jill... Myr...</i>

00:14:58.170 --> 00:15:00.000
<i>Please be safe!</i>

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:06.000
<b>[Ullmina's Miracle] 
She has the ability to control the dead as she pleases. 
Enemies or allies alike are manipulated, so long as they are dead.</b>

00:15:09.500 --> 00:15:12.390
W-We can't use magic!

00:15:12.390 --> 00:15:15.420
We can't even produce a contour map.

00:15:15.420 --> 00:15:18.090
The Fantasia has grown weak again.

00:15:18.090 --> 00:15:19.750
Look over there!

00:15:21.340 --> 00:15:22.400
Newcomers?!

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:24.710
Did they still have 
that many troops remaining?

00:15:24.710 --> 00:15:27.700
But something seems strange about them.

00:15:27.700 --> 00:15:30.140
In any case, we're heavily outnumbered.

00:15:30.140 --> 00:15:31.660
Everyone, retreat!

00:15:31.660 --> 00:15:34.050
Gather all our scattered forces!

00:15:34.050 --> 00:15:35.380
Return to the castle gate!

00:15:35.380 --> 00:15:38.040
We will build our last line 
of defense there!

00:15:41.900 --> 00:15:43.790
<i>Myr, where are you?</i>

00:15:44.750 --> 00:15:46.040
<i>I found him!</i>

00:15:48.230 --> 00:15:49.550
Ocoho!

00:15:49.550 --> 00:15:50.550
Melie!

00:15:50.890 --> 00:15:51.860
Get on!

00:15:51.860 --> 00:15:52.930
Okay!

00:15:53.850 --> 00:15:55.140
Time to fly!

00:15:56.620 --> 00:15:59.610
Myr! Myr!

00:16:03.870 --> 00:16:04.960
<i>Myr! There he is!</i>

00:16:06.590 --> 00:16:08.740
It's not safe here anymore! Come on!

00:16:08.740 --> 00:16:09.710
We have to hurry!

00:16:10.780 --> 00:16:11.980
Oh, my love...

00:16:12.420 --> 00:16:16.320
Please, say something. 
I beg of you.

00:16:18.130 --> 00:16:20.780
No... This can't be.

00:16:21.580 --> 00:16:24.580
Hey, Seth! What is it this... time...

00:16:25.990 --> 00:16:28.000
Your Majesty! Lord Brangoire!

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:28.980
Ocoho?

00:16:28.980 --> 00:16:30.370
And... um...

00:16:30.370 --> 00:16:31.300
It's me!

00:16:31.300 --> 00:16:32.720
Doc?!

00:16:33.530 --> 00:16:36.590
Jill... My babies...

00:16:40.290 --> 00:16:43.480
Hey, that's the thing
 I was inside, isn't it?

00:16:43.480 --> 00:16:45.480
Yes, it is.

00:16:45.480 --> 00:16:49.230
Then they're like my little siblings!

00:16:49.970 --> 00:16:52.080
That's true.

00:16:52.080 --> 00:16:55.110
Nature is all one big family.

00:16:55.110 --> 00:16:58.540
"Family," huh? I like that!

00:17:01.180 --> 00:17:05.250
Jill... You were much too kind.

00:17:05.250 --> 00:17:11.590
If you hadn't stopped me, 
I would have slaughtered the humans long ago!

00:17:12.380 --> 00:17:16.350
If I had done that, 
this never would have happened!

00:17:17.170 --> 00:17:18.260
"Myrddin"...

00:17:18.760 --> 00:17:23.050
You called me by my real name 
when you were angry with me.

00:17:23.050 --> 00:17:26.020
And then you would always say,

00:17:26.020 --> 00:17:29.690
"This land does not belong to you!"

00:17:29.690 --> 00:17:33.400
And you were right, but...

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:38.660
You are no longer here to stop me!

00:17:48.770 --> 00:17:52.030
Jill... I swear to you.

00:17:52.800 --> 00:17:55.550
I will take revenge on the humans.

00:17:55.550 --> 00:17:58.550
I'll slaughter every last one of them!

00:18:04.060 --> 00:18:05.320
Seth!

00:18:05.320 --> 00:18:07.560
Don't lose yourself!

00:18:10.900 --> 00:18:11.690
No!

00:18:11.690 --> 00:18:12.690
Wait!

00:18:12.690 --> 00:18:15.190
Seth!

00:18:17.820 --> 00:18:20.470
That monster... was Myr?

00:18:20.470 --> 00:18:23.290
Yes! That's his true form.

00:18:23.290 --> 00:18:24.540
We have to get to safety!

00:18:24.540 --> 00:18:26.650
<i>No, wait. He is...</i>

00:18:26.650 --> 00:18:28.550
<i>Yes... He really is...</i>

00:18:29.010 --> 00:18:30.500
Myrddin...

00:18:30.820 --> 00:18:34.590
That name... That divine name...

00:18:34.590 --> 00:18:36.750
belongs to the great Merlin!

00:18:42.550 --> 00:18:43.540
Seth...

00:18:43.990 --> 00:18:46.850
He's losing himself 
and turning into a beast.

00:18:47.630 --> 00:18:50.480
If I summon another Spectre, 
can I stop him?

00:18:50.480 --> 00:18:52.930
No, my stone is gone.

00:18:54.580 --> 00:18:57.550
Why can't I do anything?

00:18:57.550 --> 00:19:01.700
My attack on the Thaumaturge 
ultimately didn't work, either.

00:19:02.300 --> 00:19:05.740
Is there nothing I can do to help?

00:19:05.740 --> 00:19:07.730
That's not true at all.

00:19:08.710 --> 00:19:11.590
Because you summoned the Spectre,

00:19:11.590 --> 00:19:14.500
I was able to find you.

00:19:14.500 --> 00:19:16.310
Piodon...

00:19:17.050 --> 00:19:20.580
It's been a long time. I've missed you,

00:19:20.580 --> 00:19:21.700
my brother.

00:19:40.850 --> 00:19:43.880
<i>I feel so heavy. 
My strength is gone.</i>

00:19:43.880 --> 00:19:49.090
H-Hey! You guys are the ones 
who wanted to come here!

00:19:49.090 --> 00:19:51.760
<i>O-On Merlin's name,</i>

00:19:51.760 --> 00:19:55.930
<i>we cannot move without Fantasia.</i>

00:19:55.930 --> 00:19:57.500
Hey! You're heavy!

00:19:57.500 --> 00:20:00.280
You're being irresponsible! Let me out!

00:20:01.170 --> 00:20:03.330
<i>Child with the ugly voice...</i>

00:20:03.330 --> 00:20:05.130
<i>We leave the rest to you.</i>

00:20:05.130 --> 00:20:07.890
Whose voice are you calling "ugly"?!

00:20:08.860 --> 00:20:10.920
Hey! Wait up!

00:20:10.920 --> 00:20:11.900
We found it!

00:20:11.900 --> 00:20:13.500
Wait here, Doc!

00:20:18.650 --> 00:20:20.150
So this is...

00:20:20.150 --> 00:20:22.010
Let's destroy it at once!

00:20:22.010 --> 00:20:24.900
And then we need to hurry 
and save Seth!

00:20:26.160 --> 00:20:30.540
Your Majesty, don't get close! 
It's too dangerous!

00:20:30.540 --> 00:20:33.250
Oh, Myrddin...

00:20:33.250 --> 00:20:35.820
Why did this happen?

00:20:36.270 --> 00:20:42.420
The god... The beloved god 
I trusted the most...

00:21:02.140 --> 00:21:04.200
Major, what is that?!

00:21:04.510 --> 00:21:07.160
Oh, the poor thing!

00:21:07.160 --> 00:21:09.250
It's dangerous here!

00:21:09.250 --> 00:21:11.390
We must retreat immediately!

00:21:11.390 --> 00:21:12.290
We mustn't.

00:21:12.290 --> 00:21:13.380
But—

00:21:14.430 --> 00:21:18.450
I've never seen a soul 
suffering so horribly.

00:21:18.450 --> 00:21:20.370
I must save him.

00:21:28.230 --> 00:21:30.950
Our mission as the Inquisition

00:21:30.950 --> 00:21:35.690
is to guide those who have strayed 
because of tainted magic back to the light.

00:21:38.860 --> 00:21:40.990
Ah, I can sense it!

00:21:41.490 --> 00:21:46.260
The cry of his soul, 
filled with grief, pain, and rage!

00:21:46.260 --> 00:21:49.550
It's marvelous! Let me feel it, too!

00:21:50.330 --> 00:21:54.580
Oh Father of the Inquisition, 
founder of miracles...

00:21:54.580 --> 00:21:58.230
By your divine light, 
guide those who are lost!

00:22:01.300 --> 00:22:05.490
Oh, what intense pain!

00:22:05.490 --> 00:22:08.550
That's it. Take all of that agony...

00:22:09.110 --> 00:22:12.210
and give it to me.

00:22:12.850 --> 00:22:18.410
Oh, soul of purest black, be at ease.

00:22:18.410 --> 00:22:22.280
Your impurity can be cleansed within me.

00:22:22.280 --> 00:22:27.530
Now, let us share that agony...

00:22:25.990 --> 00:22:29.990
To Be Continued

00:22:28.030 --> 00:22:29.990
for all eternity.

00:24:00.020 --> 00:24:20.700
<b>Next Time</b>

00:24:00.870 --> 00:24:05.470
<i>In his despair, Myr goes on a rampage 
to destroy everything.</i>

00:24:05.970 --> 00:24:10.380
<i>Queen Boudica is brought to her knees, 
and Seth has been captured.</i>

00:24:10.990 --> 00:24:13.080
<i>In this greatest of crises,</i>

00:24:13.080 --> 00:24:20.020
<i>can Seth, Melie, Ocoho,
 and Dragunov stop Myr?</i>

00:24:20.340 --> 00:24:24.170
<i>Next time on <i>Radiant</i>, 
"A Bouquet of Flowers for This Land."</i>

00:24:20.700 --> 00:24:25.040
<b>A Bouquet of Flowers for This Land 
-Fantasia-</b>

00:24:25.020 --> 00:24:50.070
<b>Now, give all your agony to me.</b>

00:24:25.020 --> 00:24:50.070
<b>End</b>
